WEBVTT

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.540
Come, Princess Nadia.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.000
I'd like to introduce someone to you.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.920
Your majesty, Emperor Neo!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.130
Princess Nadia is here.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.050
I see. Thank you.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.390
Are you Nadia?

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.430
That's the Blue Water!

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:10.150
Yes, your father's memento.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.200
Emperor Neo,

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.950
we'd like to ask you to help our Neo Atlantis rise once again.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:24.410
I will.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.430
Red Noah?

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:51.650
Yes, Sir! We found it at PX703, the ruins of old Atlantis.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.110
So, it was in that pile of junk after all.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:59.320
It's not a pile of junk! It's a holy graveyard!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:04.700
It has no use for living men. It's just a pile of junk.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.870
Speaking of junk, what happened to Nemo's ship?

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:17.510
Sir! We can't detect any life signs or energy reactions.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:20.800
The engine must have melted down and vaporized it.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.090
I see.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.640
Let us pray for them.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.150
Jean...

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.440
Amazing!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.780
I never imagined there was such a big tunnel under this continent.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.650
Not just under Africa.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.360
Under all five continents and seven oceans,

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.870
there are tunnels like this.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.290
Was this also made by the ancient Atlanteans?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.710
Yes. The old Nautilus whose trim controls were broken

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:59.380
was saved because it was carried by an underwater tide to this tunnel.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.760
I see!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.010
We must thank the ancient Atlanteans.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.680
In any case, no matter who is responsible, we've been saved!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:11.100
All we have to do now is save Nadia and defeat the space battleship!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.940
No, that's not all.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.060
Now that Gargoyle has the Blue Waters,

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.820
he will launch the Red Noah, and fulfill his long cherished desire.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.870
Impossible! Is this Red Noah?

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:34.920
Yes, the ship that will restore Atlantis' control over the world.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.010
Now, shall I guide you to the other Noah's ark?

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.010
Once he gets the Red Noah,

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.560
Gargoyle will proceed with his final plan.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.480
What's that?

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.940
I will make a declaration of war on the world.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.060
That's crazy.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.020
Far from it, my dear Nadia.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.820
There's nothing in this world greater than Red Noah.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.240
Anyone who acts against us will be punished.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:13.200
Foolish humans cannot even hope to touch this ship.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.670
That's right. Humans do not have the power to defeat the Red Noah.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.630
This ship, made by the super science of Atlantis,

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.510
is the only one that can beat the Red Noah.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.720
But this ship is not yet perfect.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.350
We haven't checked out the main engine yet.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:34.480
It's been sealed within the Earth for more than 12,000 years.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.190
But it could fly if the main engine worked right.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.400
Fly?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.310
Yes.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.150
A ship can fly in the sky?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:49.030
Yes, both the Red Noah and this ship were spaceships at first.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.200
Spaceships?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.410
Yes, both ships are relics of the people of Atlantis

00:05:54.410 --> 00:06:00.210
when they made an emergency landing on Earth 2,400,000 years ago.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.540
That means...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:05.380
Yes, the former Nautilus was originally the same thing.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.640
You mean like the one in Red Noah, too?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.260
Yes, a pocket battleship.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:17.180
This light speed interstellar spaceship,

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:22.270
the Eritrium, was the prototype of the old Nautilus.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.110
Eritrium?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.110
That plate!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.820
Yes, it was used for the spaceship.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:35.870
But can this ship compete with that huge Red Noah even if it can fly?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.200
Exactly.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.410
Yes, it can!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:44.460
This light speed intersidereal space battleship

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.130
originally bore the name Excelion.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.600
The main engine is the same as Red Noah's, a large-sized Orpheus type.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.180
So, it has a particle annihilation engine?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.890
Actually...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.400
We are using a flywheel as the auxiliary engine.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.860
Is that the auxiliary engine?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.150
Even the terrible power of the particle annihilation engine

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.110
cannot beat the Red Noah?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:12.910
No, only an Orpheus furnace can defeat an Orpheus furnace.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.490
I see.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.790
I get it now.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:16.330
Wait for me, Nadia.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.830
I know it's logical, but...
Wait for me, Nadia.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.410
I'll be there to rescue you!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.840
Follow me, Princess Nadia.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.300
I will show you around this ship,

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.300
in place of your dead father.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.850
How do you like your outfit?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.850
We checked your sizes and made it especially for you.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.890
Do you like it?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.560
Of course not! I'm embarrassed.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:48.280
I'm sorry. I myself like it very much.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.160
Do you know what this is?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.460
A human hand? A giant?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:09.840
Yes, the first human being made by the ancient Atlanteans.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.880
His name is Adam.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.090
Adam?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:19.520
Yes, the Old Testament says that God created him in the beginning.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.180
Is he a human being?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.310
He's an experimental one.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.310
It seems this was the smallest size they could make.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:31.070
They kept improving it until it reached its present size.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.780
So, you mean that human beings are...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:39.950
Yes, they were made as servants for the people of Atlantis.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.170
It was more than 2,400,000 years ago.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:50.170
The Atlanteans tried to make loyal servants for themselves

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:54.760
when they came to Earth because they were too few in number.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:09:00.310
First, they used the whales who seemed relatively intellectual,

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.310
but they failed.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.940
Their descendants survive to this day.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.360
Like Irion at the South Pole?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.820
Yes, you know of him.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.990
They used primates next.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.870
They gave them a rather high intelligence

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.540
in order to be able to use them conveniently, and then...

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:28.080
They made human beings that looked like the Atlanteans themselves.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:32.670
You mean we are not evolved from apes?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.880
Do you know the term "missing link", Jean?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.470
Missing link?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:42.180
Yes, human beings are said to have evolved from apes.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.980
But why are humans so different from apes?

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.520
Why is the hair gone from their body?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:55.530
Why can man use tools? Why can man speak?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.410
We still don't know how to fill in the blanks.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:03.290
The link that ties human beings and the apes,

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.910
that part of the trail is missing.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.250
What if the people of Atlantis forged that link?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.670
Yes, then it all makes sense.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.720
But how can you make man from monkeys?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:18.930
That would be...

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.390
Through genetics.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.850
Genetics?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:28.230
Yes, it's like a blueprint used to form man.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.860
It was the ancient Atlanteans who created this plan.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:35.530
This...

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.820
Oh, these.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.290
They are humans not yet completed, or failed experiments.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.130
This is a museum of human beings.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.090
It's awful.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:03.600
Really? You shouldn't be so surprised.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:09.140
We, the Atlanteans, are their creators and their masters.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:12.980
You must fully realize this, Princess Nadia.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.190
No, never.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.150
That won't do.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:31.170
What's wrong, Princess Nadia? Don't you have anything to say?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.630
Of course not!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.000
That's too bad.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:42.590
I'd like to talk to you for our mutual understanding.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.430
I'd rather die than help you!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:48.140
Nadia!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.690
Please don't say such sad things.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:12:00.610
You are going to live with me. Do not be so stubborn.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.950
I hate you!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.530
You don't like me.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.040
It seems you like humans better than me,

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.330
even though we're both of Atlantis.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:15.290
Of course! Why don't you live with the human beings?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.970
You say the same things Nemo did.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:25.260
You are father and daughter after all, although separated.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.300
You are not answering my question!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.770
Nadia, look more closely at human beings.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:36.770
They discriminate among themselves to maintain their own happiness.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:41.240
They are shameful beings with no sense of honor.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:46.450
In addition, you are an alien. They will never accept you.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:48.660
I don't think so.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:54.620
Human beings can never be improved. They're good for nothing.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.960
They need a master like us.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.210
I don't think so!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.720
This is a sad reality.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.680
I'm not interested in living with animals.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.510
That's why you keep coldly killing men?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.980
You've become a devil using my Blue Water.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.640
You are wrong.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:21.690
His Majesty the Emperor is the true successor to the Blue Water.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:27.700
Yes, I have now inherited the Blue Water from my father.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.410
Brother?

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:44.630
Yes! I let you escape thirteen years ago.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:53.560
Somehow, I couldn't kill my own sister.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:59.270
It could have been our fate to meet like this again.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.860
What a sad fate. You know I want to destroy you.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.070
A fruitless wish.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.570
I'll realize it by any means!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:12.490
You should give it up. I saved your life once.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.000
I don't want to kill you.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.250
Your Majesty...

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:23.500
We're almost in Paris. Please get ready.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.550
I understand.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:34.100
You must follow me.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.560
You should understand your situation.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.820
What's that?

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.920
A giant!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:15.810
I am the Emperor of Neo Atlantis, Neo Icon Epiphanes.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:18.980
Today, I address all the people of the world.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.520
We are the creators of humanity.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.400
We are your true masters.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.400
Therefore, you must obey us.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:33.870
Those who will not obey us must expiate their sins.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.120
You will only be allowed to live as the servants of Neo Atlantis,

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:43.630
following our orders.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.340
For those fools who do not understand this fact,

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.630
I will show you the light of divine punishment.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:30.420
First, surrender the little country called England.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:35.140
Place a white flag on the Eiffel Tower as proof.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:38.010
If you don't obey me,

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:43.730
divine punishment will be visited upon the town of London.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.730
They've taken action at last.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.650
Yes, they really mean to start a war against the world.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.780
What's going to happen?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.870
The end of the world.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.080
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.490
But the way things are going...

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.120
Don't worry.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.710
We've checked out the furnace already.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.250
This ship can make it.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.960
The Katherine has been remodeled too.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.210
And evil never prospers...

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.300
In any time or place!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:19.260
You are correct, but you misunderstand us.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:23.020
We are not evil, but good!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.520
How arrogant!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.230
By no means!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:31.480
We are trying to lead this foolish mankind

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.950
in order to save them from taking the wrong path.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:43.410
They will destroy themselves if we do not take control of them.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:48.630
You yourselves destroyed Atlantis in one day and a night.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.840
Yet human beings still survive.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:58.050
Atlantis is immortal. I embody their eternal will.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:05.430
Now, the time has come for you to help us.

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:13.320
Everyone, thank you for coming this far with me,

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:19.620
but it will bring you only death if you continue to follow me.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:23.450
You don't have to do this. Please stay here on the ground.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.080
I have one more thing to say to you.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.040
Thank you.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:02.660
Wait!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:03.490
Don't!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.040
No, I'm coming with you!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.660
You can't! You must stay.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.420
Grandpa...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:15.880
Find a nice guy, marry him and bring up some children.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.220
We'll make a world where you can all live with a sense of security.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.890
Grandpa!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.060
Everybody is gone now!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:39.280
I don't like you, but there's no one else to ask.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.610
Will you look after Marie and King?

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.870
All right, we'll wait for you in England.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.790
Marie, I'll be back soon.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.750
Okay, see you later.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.420
Right!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:07.720
Captain, we've just closed the hatches.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.850
Everybody's aboard.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.480
Let's do it together, as comrades.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.190
Thank you...

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.900
Captain! We're going with you.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.070
Here...

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.080
Jean!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.580
We're not going in order to die, are we?

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.580
Yes, you're right.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.180
Prepare for takeoff!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.640
Prepare for takeoff!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.970
Engine start!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:56.560
Auxiliary engine, no problem.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:58.110
Power systems are stable.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.320
Connect to the furnace!

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.030
Connected!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.780
Furnace pressure increasing. Passing nominal limit.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.240
Gyrocompass, working normally.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.330
Power is being transmitted

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.660
to the anti-gravity screw and the particle propeller.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:16.540
No obstacles within a 60km radius.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.540
No problems in any section! Ready for takeoff!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.470
Let's go! New Nautilus, takeoff!

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.910
Are you crying?

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.660
No, it's nothing.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.130
You okay?

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.130
Yeah.

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:12.890
Lord Gargoyle, their time is up.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:16.310
What are those humans doing?

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.990
What fools!

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:31.120
They're going to die for their own pitiful pride.

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:34.540
Light of Babel, prepare to fire!

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.370
Target set for London.

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:40.960
Release all safety systems.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:44.170
Orbital adjustment of servant star Michael complete.

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:47.470
Light of Babel is ready to fire.

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.640
Take your regrets to Hell, foolish humans!

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:00.850
A strong energy source is chasing the Light of Babel!

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:11.950
Michael has exploded!

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:13.370
That's impossible!

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:15.330
A flying object is approaching from the east.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:16.870
Its altitude is 825 meters.

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:20.580
Its speed is 12,000km per hour!

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:21.920
Unbelievable!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.920
There can't be anything like that in this world!

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:26.170
Impossible!

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:28.630
Of course! Nemo is alive.

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:40.270
You stubbornly try to upset me, Nemo.

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:45.230
The time has come for a fight to the death, Gargoyle.
